# Keep LF in the repository and in working trees on every platform. Without
# this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows checks out CRLF, which makes `gofmt -l`
# (and therefore `make fmt-check`) fail locally while CI stays green.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
